    <string name="btn_copy_secret">Copy Secret Key</string>
    <string name="detail_secret_note">Write this on paper and keep it safe. Old phones can die without warning. The digits 0, 1, 8 and 9 are never used: a round letter is O, a straight one is I. You can type it back with the spaces. Also keep the recovery codes each service gives you when you turn on two-step login.</string>
